## How to Reproduce

```bash
# 1. Acquire a pod
ce kiln-pod-acquire --gpu-type 'NVIDIA L40S' --task-id pi-diff-patch-apply-repro

# 2. Bootstrap (kiln-setup.sh + cargo build + npm pi install)
# 3. Build corpus + sanity check
cd capabilities/agentic-grpo/pi-diff-patch-apply
python3 build_corpus.py --train 60 --eval 24
python3 rubric_sanity.py

# 4. Run the best iter
bash run_iter.sh --iter <best> --kind train --num-train-tasks <N> --num-gens <G> --lr <LR> --filter-var <FV>
```

